{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:41:03+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:41:03+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Savencia SA","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"France","city":"Viroflay","website":"https://savencia-fromagedairy.com","employees":22680,"summary":"Savencia SA produces, distributes, and markets dairy and cheese products in France, the Rest of Europe, and internationally. The company offers cheese, butter, creams, and dairy ingredients and nutritional solutions for the retail market and food services market. It offers its products under the Caprice des Dieux, Saint Albray, Le Rustique, Cur de Lion, blue chesses, such as Saint Agur, Bresse Bleu, and PDO Roquefort Papillon; fresh cheeses, such as St-Morêt, Tartare, Carré Frais, Apérivrais; goat cheese, including Chavroux, Saint-Loup, RichesMonts raclette, Géramont, Saint Albray, Fol Epi, Bresso, Milkana, Brunch, Île-de-France, Milkaut, Santa Rosa, Delaco, Kral Syru, Lucina, Medve, Alouette, Rogue Creamery, Polenghi, Corman, and Elle & Vire brands. The company was formerly known as Bongrain SA and changed its name to Savencia SA in April 2015. Savencia SA was founded in 1956 and is headquartered in Viroflay, France. Savencia SA operates as a subsidiary of Savencia Holding.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Savencia SA produit, distribue et commercialise des produits laitiers et fromagers en France, dans le reste de l’Europe et à l’international. La société propose du fromage, du beurre, des crèmes et des ingrédients laitiers ainsi que des solutions nutritionnelles pour le marché de détail et le marché des services alimentaires. Elle propose ses produits sous le Caprice des Dieux, Saint Albray, Le Rustique, Cur de Lion, échecs bleus, tels que Saint Agur, Bresse Bleu, et AOP Roquefort Papillon; fromages frais, tels que